     ```xml
     <network-security-config>
         <base-config>
             <trust-anchors>
                 <certificates src="system" />
                 <certificates src="user" /> <!-- BAD -->
             </trust-anchors>
         </base-config>
         <debug-overrides>
             <trust-anchors>
                 <certificates src="user" /> <!-- OK -->
             </trust-anchors>
         </debug-overrides>
     </network-security-config>
     ```
   - So, for each `<trust-anchors>`, check its parent. If parent is `<debug-overrides>`, it's fine.
   - If parent is `<base-config>`, `<domain-config>`, or root `<network-security-config>`, and it contains `<certificates src="user">`, report it.
